meta {
  name: Search ServiceRequest
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{gatewayUrl}}/fhir/ServiceRequest?_id=ReferralOrthopedicSurgery
  params:query {
    _id: ReferralOrthopedicSurgery
  }
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  ServiceRequest search. capability-guard REQUIRES _id (remove it to see the 400
  OperationOutcome). Resolving the resource then depends on OPA consent /
  fhirContext — for a real read, use an access token minted with the matching
  authorization_details (fhirContext).
}
